# Cloudflare Pages URL canonicalization (301)
# Collapse legacy *.html variants onto the canonical extensionless URLs so
# old bookmarks/search results/caches land on the canonical form, and Google
# never sees two URLs serving identical content. Both EN and zh trees get the
# same treatment so the URL structure is unified across languages.
#
# The extensionless forms resolve natively on Cloudflare Pages (it serves
# foo.html for /foo); these rules make the .html forms redirect to them.

/guide/how-to-open-ithmb-files.html    /guide/how-to-open-ithmb-files    301
/zh/guide/how-to-open-ithmb-files.html /zh/guide/how-to-open-ithmb-files 301

/ithmb-decoder/index.html              /ithmb-decoder/                   301
/enterprise/index.html                 /enterprise/                      301
/zh/index.html                         /zh/                              301
/zh/ithmb-decoder/index.html           /zh/ithmb-decoder/                301
/zh/enterprise/index.html              /zh/enterprise/                   301

/index.html                            /                                 301
